    {
      "id": "claim_0a78c2bdf67240dc837408ff8ae482d8",
      "statement": "service_book is gated in order: shared sender checks, then marketplace_policy auto_accept (default off -> PERMISSION_DENIED error envelope), then the booking record {service, when, client_fingerprint: sender, status: 'reserved'} is built and, when an on_task executor exists, handed to the task pipeline; when no executor is configured the booking is still reported as a completed reservation with status reserved and no backend side effect.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://haap/server.py#L371-L406",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:4e76c3d23f8176384da91c550f611b8ae7c37c70a4fe88736d5c9514c3fae1ce:"
        },
        {
          "resource": "repo://tests/test_marketplace.py#L56-L69",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:2db13412ba37342dd04a9775ca4c3ef55600f187a26dfb5e6d7fdf83a7766f65:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_60ab14a7664a476b9c9cd04dbe9636bb",
      "statement": "Marketplace bookings reuse the task pipeline: the server creates a task with role server, action booking:reserve and resource equal to the service, invokes on_task(task_id, <the raw service_book payload>) so the booking reaches the business backend (e.g. a CalDAV or iCalendar write), merges the callback's returned dict into the booking record, walks the legal transitions submitted -> accepted -> completed, and on a callback exception marks the task failed and replies a signed error envelope with TASK_ERROR.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://demo_marketplace.py#L45-L58",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:c8e31f157222627a86b10e307da5200c46e01e18de085c01018fbdda88359331:"
        },
        {
          "resource": "repo://haap/server.py#L383-L402",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:b3c81571ece20d4656402822c88ebf87ca4bb0e2cf44757dd1c9e34614115aa3:"
        },
        {
          "resource": "repo://haap/tasks.py#L40-L49",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:40267042dba0e50e59308953fedc4c6faee6efde0fe3b0f3a93e198db7fbd770:"
        },
        {
          "resource": "repo://tests/test_marketplace.py#L56-L69",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:2db13412ba37342dd04a9775ca4c3ef55600f187a26dfb5e6d7fdf83a7766f65:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_f206c13d32db4a9895249b38a3b39688",
      "statement": "A successful service_book is answered with a signed task_result envelope whose task_id is 'MKT-' plus epoch seconds, state completed, and detail equal to the merged booking; HAAPClient.service_book returns that raw task_result payload (task_id/state/detail) rather than unwrapping the booking fields, so booking fields are nested under detail.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://haap/client.py#L254-L273",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:11c5b52ac7ab8a75ce3d868aa2f7447316eb492173990574bbf8884c16faf1d6:"
        },
        {
