    {
      "id": "claim_1181d0f258f94ea7b7b4bcc6140b81aa",
      "statement": "The public capability manifest advertises only MESSAGE_TYPES_PUBLIC and deliberately omits the service_* marketplace types, so open services are gated by marketplace policy rather than advertised as offered capabilities; marketplace discovery means discovering the business (fingerprint and endpoint via registry or well-known) and then learning services by asking with service_search.",
