    {
      "id": "claim_1fcebdfb87b043d5acceda75d84835cb",
      "statement": "demo_marketplace.py is the canonical working example of the workflow: two full agents with real Ed25519 identities (business Peluqueria Euraka publishing the corte/corte+barba catalog with auto_accept True, personal agent Agente Personal) running over real loopback HTTP, where the business's on_task writes an iCalendar appointment into demo_data/citas_peluqueria.ics and the personal agent drives service_search then service_book end to end, finishing by printing the calendar file and the business's audit trail.",
